Sources: Article 6(2) (aiact:art_6:para_2@2024-08-01); Article 6(1)(a) (aiact:art_6:para_1:point_a@2024-08-01); Annex III(3)(b) (aiact:anx_III:area_3:item_b@2024-08-01); Article 6(3), third subparagraph (aiact:art_6:para_3:subpara_3@2024-08-01)

