- The system’s student-test monitoring function fits the education category in Annex III(3)(d), which Article 6(2) uses for risk classification. Article 6(3), third subparagraph, links the derogation to the significance of harm and influence on decisions, while treating profiling of natural persons as decisive regardless of that derogation. [Article 6(2); Annex III(3)(d); Article 6(3), third subparagraph]
